Action Input: {"smiles": "C1=CC2C=NC=C2C=C1"}

Thought: The SMILES string "C1=CC2C=NC=C2C=C1" is also valid. I will continue validating the remaining SMILES strings to ensure all potential isomers are correctly represented.
