Action Input: {"smiles": "[2H]C([2H])(C#N)C1=CC=CC=C1"}

Thought: The SMILES string "[2H]C([2H])(C#N)C1=CC=CC=C1" is valid. I will proceed to validate the next SMILES string in the list.
